{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0d105e6a56fc8f35ab0db4a325796eab5a9578312314193c10df82f6cc9b8168", "ja": "（サスペンスホラー映画『誰ソ彼ノ淵』の試写会は\n大盛況だった。頑張った甲斐があったな、みんな！）", "zh": "（悬疑恐怖电影《黄昏之渊》的试映会盛况空前。大家的努力没有白费啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "866d781dae2f4d6130a720a5c9367663c4e06d01e4edd1e638d68cc17554cb91", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}ちゃん、見た見た！？\n茜ちゃんたちの映画、最高だったよね！", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}，看到了吗看到了吗！？  \n小茜他们的电影，超棒的对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "76f01ee8e334f436f68f9d97c608e7174c364ec8a51cc100786741ae5716c7ae", "ja": "ああ、良い映画だった。客席からも、\nすごく怖かったって感想が聞こえてきたよ。", "zh": "嗯，确实是部很棒的电影。我还听到观众席那边传来“太恐怖了”的感想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "eb635c6dee74f9dc911914a231bad994edf1be775526ccade04b8eb079264435", "ja": "うんうん。その反応を待っていた……！", "zh": "嗯嗯。我等的就是这种反应……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "86fc8c5ff321d98f9a00ddec7b856c3e677f3f3f697aaa2a21b46c536ee4cedc", "ja": "観に来てくれるみんなが本気で怖がるようにって、\nすっごくがんばったんだから。", "zh": "为了让来看的大家真的感到害怕，我可是拼了全力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1005_p", "source_sha256": "31bd5ed32ee6af8e13bb0bb8e9ee1bc4960e74648dc464d65705bc0cf55ad5b4", "ja": "そうだな。\n改めて茜、本当にお疲れさま。", "zh": "是啊。茜，真的辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "859be6cfd169a834ad378129782c57d86cc71a117eb8ebeb4e87a9cd9a10a9fa", "ja": "やだな～{$P$}ちゃん、ホントに\n改まっちゃって。それに、元はと言えば……。", "zh": "讨厌啦～{$P$}，真是的，\n干嘛这么郑重其事嘛。而且，追根究底……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "3f828a02213ee4fcf4da7732d8f63a501e4ec8436a9b170eaf4a7e82be71971d", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんが茜ちゃんたちに、\n映画のオーディションを受けさせてくれたからでしょ？", "zh": "也是多亏了{$P$}给小茜她们争取到了参加电影试镜的机会吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "1875ad7ffbf9d96234675e6cf801994b1b1e1062f4f498cca3f5041a85e8fbf9", "ja": "いやー、さすが{$P$}ちゃんは\n敏腕だな～。すごいよね、尊敬しちゃうな～！", "zh": "哎呀——不愧是{$P$}，真是个能干的制作人啊～。太厉害了，真让人佩服～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ec84abb42f51dfd51ac42c18fcef6d8d1ecd2b6c68f475a8ad70ee7186dabc2c", "ja": "…………茜。\n今回の要求はなんだ？", "zh": "…………茜。\n这次的要求是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "463f930a743f30978ddaf1bae5bfa0c1c7b8a42b87243f2437366b8823530cce", "ja": "えっ！？　要求？　要求ってなんのこと？\n茜ちゃん、何も要求なんてしてないよ？", "zh": "咦！？要求？你说的要求是什么意思？\n小茜，我什么要求都没提呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "20599cd2368cf428b3a7cf3a49c025a7ba95ece8ce8a65297b306b4ea28a845f", "ja": "でも、もしも{$P$}ちゃんが。\n撮影やプロモーション超がんばった茜ちゃんに……。", "zh": "不过，要是{$P$}想对在拍摄和宣传活动中超级努力的小茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "15378b5a57206f38b8e5eaef8503e51519382401a21b974cedcb6a1efca21b49", "ja": "「どうしてもご褒美あげたいなー、\nいや、あげるべきでしょ！」って言うなら……。", "zh": "要是非得说“无论如何都想给拼命拍摄、做宣传的茜酱奖励——不，应该给才对！”的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "b3b82f40f4369bf71c8da6594e09538c70f9ed66e77a667b9315338b923d47b6", "ja": "みんなとの打ち上げを要求することも、\nやぶさかではないかもしれない！", "zh": "茜也不是不可以要求\n跟大家一起办个庆功宴哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e9e8d1544b2ffed57e020149c199f3063bca0f37f68455a6659db3150f1e08bd", "ja": "打ち上げって、映画の？　撮影が終わった後に、\n盛大なのがあったじゃないか。それに劇場でも……。", "zh": "你说的庆功宴，是电影的那种吗？拍摄结束后不是办过一场盛大的庆功宴吗？而且剧场也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "7b9b717fbe516d1f73f9d039bda0e88500eac116041f5d2df27d93feb46d8816", "ja": "わかってないな～、{$P$}ちゃん！\nいい、打ち上げっていうのはね……。", "zh": "真是不懂呢～，{$P$}！\n听好了，庆功宴这种东西啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "72aeb2e1f11ed66363315c323e3fed4c69cf2d1666e172828cda7f3f3ee32aaf", "ja": "何回やっても！　超！　楽しいんだよ～！！！", "zh": "不管办几次！都超级开心的哦～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1018_p", "source_sha256": "49a157b23d916a9287824b04fe095f955432a7a30057e7669b96223bf016fdf1", "ja": "そ、そうか……。でも、予算の都合もあるし、\n何より、みんなのスケジュールが……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……不过，也得考虑预算的问题，而且最重要的是，大家的日程……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "1c1751734708bdec6ccddea6276677e9802bd7a78428e49199b09a53bb9aa80b", "ja": "スケジュールは、この日ならみんな空いてるよ☆\n予算は律子さんに確認済み！", "zh": "日程方面，这天大家都有空哦☆\n预算也已经跟律子确认过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "f262f73f5d5d1636804592f1892410d7f54c481179cffcbef3a3a9a17586dcf8", "ja": "ねーねー、{$P$}ちゃん。\nねーねー、ねーねー！", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}～\n喂喂，喂喂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1021_p", "source_sha256": "90c703643449e2401e5dd8b7a09ccebf1153c0317d7d242e6dcd821ff64fbc1c", "ja": "根回しが早いな……わかった。\nそこまで言うなら、社長に相談してみるよ。", "zh": "提前打点招呼了啊……知道了。\n既然你都这么说了，我去跟社长商量看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "e0f2401f7491453f27fe3fdf100cd5d781a809ae67c1e455a3ef2b3588b11838", "ja": "ほんと！？　やったー！\n{$P$}ちゃん、ありがとう！", "zh": "真的！？太好了——！\n{$P$}，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "5daf6f674849d7c629262d8546c4655d22fc18093a6d07a81562ecb2c88c58b0", "ja": "やっぱり、律子さんを味方につけると話が早いな～。\n使いどころがちょっぴり難しいけどね……。", "zh": "果然，争取到律子小姐的支持，事情就好办多了～。\n虽然该怎么运用还是稍微有点难呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0143_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b34c0965ba5ca66d44fae7e5b0f6f876600c63bdf87c373541c94c712399185e", "ja": "（確かに、撮影が終わった後も頑張ってたしな。今回の\n仕事で、茜も少しは成長した……のかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（确实，拍摄结束后她也一直努力来着。这次工作，茜也算是有所成长了……也许吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
